I think it's best to discuss this with the core team. Since I found the only place in the code that could be responsible for this conversion, and it's on their side.

src/rental/vehicle/rental_mqtt_decoder/main/scooter/service/BoltService.ts

src/rental/vehicle/rental_mqtt_decoder/ @bolteu/rental-core

```    private getBatteryCharge(scooterBattery: number | null | undefined): number | undefined {
        if (scooterBattery != null &amp;&amp; scooterBattery &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; scooterBattery &lt;= 100) {
            return scooterBattery;
        }
        // Cobra/Cobra2/Dragon are sending -1 when battery removal is detected by IOT.
        if (scooterBattery === -1) {
            return 0;
        }
        return undefined;
    }```

